error[R0202]: `p` is checked for nil after it was already indexed
--> 9:6: nil check here
    8:15: `p` is indexed here — throws if it is nil
  = note: every path from the last assignment of `p` to this check reaches the use first, so if `p` can be nil the use throws and this check never runs
  = help: move the check above the first use, or drop it if `p` cannot be nil
